  "reading": {
    "title": "Places in the Neighbourhood（社區地點）",
    "icon": "fa-map-location-dot",
    "intro": "社區地圖上有各種場所。認識這些地點，學習用方位詞描述它們的位置：",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "t1",
        "text": "This is a map of our neighbourhood. There is a school at the top. Next to the school is a police station, and there is a bus stop in front of it. The fire station is beside the bus stop, and the library is next to the fire station.<br>In the middle of the map, there is a shopping centre. Near the shopping centre, there is a hotel and a market. The MTR station is at the bottom of the map, next to the hospital.",
        "translation": "這是我們社區的地圖。頂部有一間學校。學校旁邊是警察局，警察局前面有一個巴士站。消防局在巴士站旁邊，圖書館在消防局旁邊。<br>地圖中間有一個購物中心。購物中心附近有一間酒店和一個街市。港鐵站在地圖底部，醫院旁邊。",
        "pairs": [
          {
            "en": "neighbourhood",
            "zh": "社區"
          },
          {
            "en": "next to",
            "zh": "在…旁邊"
          },
          {
            "en": "in front of",
            "zh": "在…前面"
          },
          {
            "en": "beside",
            "zh": "在…旁邊"
          },
          {
            "en": "near",
            "zh": "在…附近"
          },
          {
            "en": "at the bottom",
            "zh": "在底部"
          }
        ],
        "sentences": [
