        "text": "There is also a post office, a bank, a cinema and a factory in our neighbourhood. The post office is between the bank and the market. The cinema is opposite the town hall. The factory is near the pier, and the park is next to the factory.<br>Other places on the map include the bus terminus, the housing estate, the hotel and the school. We use these places every day!",
        "translation": "我們的社區還有一間郵政局、一間銀行、一間電影院和一間工廠。郵政局在銀行和街市之間。電影院在大會堂對面。工廠在碼頭附近，公園在工廠旁邊。<br>地圖上的其他地方包括巴士總站、屋邨、酒店和學校。我們每天都會用到這些地方！",
